  "description": "Syntax highlighting for Blazor, in C#: SyntaxText splits code into runs of one kind (keyword, string, type, ...) per line, for 19 languages built in (C#, Razor, JSON, bash, PowerShell, TypeScript, HTML, CSS, SQL, YAML, Markdown and more). No script, so it works the same in static rendering, Blazor Server, WebAssembly and prerendering, and SyntaxDocument re-tokenizes only the lines that change. Add languages with SyntaxGrammar or Blaizio.Syntax.Languages, configured in AddBlaizio.",
